Note on Optional Third-Party Runtime Dependencies:
ClipForge invokes external open-source tools and models at runtime (such as FFmpeg,
faster-whisper, OpenCV, Meta AI SAM 2, and optional Ultralytics YOLO weights) which
are governed by their respective licenses documented in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
docs/LICENSING_REPORT.md.
